/E (This project successfully applied web scraping and exploratory data analysis to examine posting behavior and engagement patterns in the r/datascience subreddit. The analysis revealed clear temporal and categorical patterns in posting activity and engagement, including highly skewed interaction distributions and variation across post flairs and time periods. As an exploratory study, the findings describe observed patterns rather than causal relationships, providing an overview of how engagement is distributed within the community.)
